<title>AUSTRIA: OPEC quota committee assembles for meeting.</title>
<headline>OPEC quota committee assembles for meeting.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The oil ministers of Iran, Libya and Nigeria assembled on Tuesday at the OPEC Secretariat building here for the meeting of the group's quota compliance meeting that was scheduled to start at 0900 gmt.</p>
<p>OPEC Secretary-General Rilwanu Lukman also sits on the committee.</p>
<p>-- Vienna Newsroom +431 713 2034</p>
